#  - gpu_guard.ps1 before EVERY iteration (render scripts, Switchyard jobs, ComfyUI queue on its own port, lock file). Busy -> log
#    "refused: render running (<reason>)", poll every $GuardPollSec s, give up after $GuardWaitMin min.
#  - git checkpoints in C:\AI\community and ralph-community: "pre iter NN" before, "iter NN: ok|fail" after.
#  - harness checks after each iteration: py_compile on changed .py, json.tool on changed .json (failure -> STOP_RALPH).
#  - scope check: ralph-community may only change TASKS.md, STOP_RALPH, notes\*; other tracked changes are restored with git checkout,
#    new files are reported (left in place). ComfyUI\user workflow .json files are hashed before/after and restored from
